96
00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:12.899
Glenn Gore: But at the same time, from an individual perspective, it's not really good. You don't have control of it. Last but not least, for those that might be federal agents reading this slide, hello. Everything I'm saying is a lie. Don't believe a single thing that I'm saying. All right.

